# Testing & Quality Assurance Standards

## Frontend Testing (Next.js)
- Framework: Vitest + React Testing Library + `@testing-library/user-event`.
- Test user interactions rather than internal implementation details.
- Query priority: `getByRole` > `getByLabelText` > `getByPlaceholderText` > `getByTestId`.
- Mock Supabase client calls; do not execute live network calls in unit tests.

## Backend Testing (FastAPI)
- Framework: `pytest` + `pytest-asyncio` + `httpx.AsyncClient`.
- Mock third-party LLM APIs (OpenAI/Anthropic) using `unittest.mock.patch` or `respx`.
- Mock external network requests during scraping tests.
- Test all HTTP error response codes explicitly (`400`, `401`, `422`, `500`).